    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ravenwing Dark Talon",
    "summary": "As the opposing player’s [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick 1 enemy unit **visible** to this unit and within 24\" of it, excluding **AIRCRAFT** and **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** units. That unit counts as **slowed** until the opposing player’s next [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends.\n\nWhile **slowed**, each time it is **selected to move** in that Movement phase, roll 1 D6 unless it **remains stationary**:\n\n- 1–4: it takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** and its Move characteristic is reduced by 2\"\n- 5–6: it takes 2D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) and its Move characteristic is reduced by 3\"",
